  and specifically each and every  allegation in the lawsuit  we reached out to la buff's attorney  that's sean holly who told us a lawyer  issuing  issuing general denials to all the  allegations in a lawsuit is standard  procedure in civil practice  and signals nothing about chia's past  statements or his acceptance of  responsibility  for things that he has done wrong  nothing has changed it was very  interesting talking to her she tells  some really eye-opening and jaw-dropping  things it's very troubling  but the thing that gets me it's her  first tv interview she said i've never  talked to a tv  reporter before she was a little nervous  but she didn't want to be talking to me  she said i tried to settle this  privately  i went to him and said you know if you  will get help if you will make a  donation to women's charities about  abuse  this will never see the light of day and  when he didn't she felt she had to speak  out you can understand why she wouldn't  want to  sit down with cameron rolling in the  lights on talk about those stories  yeah very private very painful and very  private look forward to seeing that  tomorrow yeah you can see more of our  interview with  fka twigs that's tomorrow on cbs this  morning and  here's something very important you need  to know if you need help related to  domestic violence we have free resources  on our website cbsnews.com
 

